{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歌手衛蘭（Janice）一共四場《JANICE VIDAL衛蘭OUT OF FRAME世界巡迴演唱會－香港站》，今晚（18號）在紅館舉行最後一場。尾場有陳明憙、關心妍、丁子高和太太楊千嬅、JW（王灝兒）和丈夫王至尊、AGA（江海迦）與未婚夫鄭子邦及林盛斌（Bob）等好友捧場。JW更是首度與丈夫王至尊以夫妻檔公開亮相，任影唔嬲。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.779981+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T13:31:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:59.417769+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:59.417769+00:00","content_hash":"055887435581e21686db51444d99a21ba6cd0d6f63b6fc747edad7d039ce50a6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}